{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pulls/73","id":5413550116,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVjVyDc8AAAABQqw4JA","html_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pull/73","diff_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pull/73.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pull/73.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/issues/73","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pulls/73/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pulls/73/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/issues/73/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/statuses/73b53918e2de76d97d9f9cf7dff1706cc9d124b5","number":73,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"P0 security: require account-bound biometric proof metadata","user":{"login":"productionhome2022-hash","id":348720557,"node_id":"U_kgDOFMkNrQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348720557?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash","html_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n- Require account-bound, server-verifier-produced biometric proof metadata before biometric verification can unlock profile/social-link and message-link privileges.\n- Bind every proof check to the canonical user UID.\n- Reject legacy verified flags, client OS prompts, mismatched account/device proof metadata, invalid timestamps, unverified attestation/signature markers and unconsumed nonce state.\n- Preserve the ability to clear links or hide them after expiry/revocation.\n- Document the verifier-result contract and explicitly record that the cryptographic provider verifiers and challenge lifecycle are still not implemented.\n\n## Security boundary\nThis is a fail-closed hardening step, **not completion of cryptographic attestation**. The Android Play Integrity and iOS App Attest verifiers, device-key enrollment, challenge issuance/consumption, proof-to-evidence binding and Owner review workflow remain open under Issue #72. The 1,500-coin reward and biometric privileges remain disabled; Owner acceptance alone cannot grant them.\n\n## Tests\nAdded/updated unit coverage for account binding, proof shape, provider allowlist, signature/attestation markers, nonce consumption, timestamps, expiry/revocation and link clear/hide behavior. Exact-head GitHub Actions results are pending.\n\n## Constraints\nDraft PR to the unified development branch only. No main merge, deployment, production Firebase mutation, billing, financial operation or 5,000-persona simulation.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-20T12:45:52Z","updated_at":"2026-11-26T16:50:46Z","closed_at":"2026-11-20T12:57:46Z","merged_at":"2026-11-20T12:57:46Z","merge_commit_sha":"0486afa